Package: maketimeliner
Title: Non-Linear Multi-Stream Timelines as Interactive HTML and SVG
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Shimpei", "Morimoto", email = "mrmt.shmp@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws non-linear chronological diagrams in which several
    timelines (actors, issues, proposals) move along a time axis while
    crossing between parallel streams, as in Kingdon's Multiple Streams
    Framework. Input follows the 'matxingraphout' model: a node-property
    table (events placed by time and stream) plus an adjacency matrix whose
    cell values are timeline codes, styled through an edge-property table.
    Streams, windows, ordinal phases, legends and settings are plain tables
    importable from CSV. Output is a static SVG and a self-contained
    interactive HTML file; an optional Shiny app edits every table.
